---
// 무료 임베드 위젯 (REV5): the 여권·증명사진 tool for a host site's iframe (/embed/ explains it). Not in the sitemap, not
// precached, via=embed on every usage event (src/lib/ui/usage.ts arrival).
import Embed from '../../../layouts/Embed.astro';
import IdPhotoTool from '../../../components/IdPhotoTool.astro';
import { getTool } from '../../../data/tools';
import { SITE } from '../../../data/site';

const tool = getTool('id-photo');
---
<Embed title={`${tool.name} | ${SITE.name}`} description={tool.description} tool="/id-photo/">
  <h1 class="visually-hidden">{tool.h1}</h1>
  <IdPhotoTool embed />
</Embed>

